  _name: Potatoes for the Pot
  _description: Bring 10 potatoes
  _storyDescription: A proper village meal needs potatoes. Ten of them, to be precise. The cook insists this is not negotiable.
  _activeQuestDialogue: 'The cook needs ten potatoes for the village meal. Please bring them before the pot is taken off the fire.'
  _turnInDialogue: 'The potatoes are in the pot, and dinner is saved. Thank you for keeping the village fed.'
  _completedQuestDialogueLines:
  - 'The potatoes are in the pot, and the cook is smiling again. Thank you.'
  - 'You rescued dinner from becoming a very small stew. The whole village appreciates it.'
  - 'The cook says this will be the best meal all week. I told them you made it possible.'
